83236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1924430/extras/71e1f722523a8f46d78b659acc694e51.webm?t=1741883236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1924430/extras/71e1f722523a8f46d78b659acc694e51.mp4?t=1741883236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Play this techno-pop-punk post-kawaii Metroidvania for yourself and learn why Den of Geek raves that Cookie Cutter is \u201cEASILY ONE OF THE BEST METROIDVANIAS OF THE YEAR.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An epic, one-of-a-kind action-adventure / Metroidvania spanning 15-plus hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience an emotional story full of quirky, lovable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a gargantuan far-future world and uncover its countless secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip Cherry with a variety of new weapons like a chainsaw and unlock her ultra powerful mecha form</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet an insane cast of allies and enemies and gain access to gated areas of the expansive world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in fast, responsive, satisfying combat, time counters perfectly and execute violent brutals on enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle huge, deadly, unforgettable bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gorgeous hand-drawn 2D visuals look like an animated feature brought to life</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1924430/extras/97c40f95bd3842e32df96a51ccd6b2dc.poster.avif?t=1741883236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1924430/extras/97c40f95bd3842e32df96a51ccd6b2dc.webm?t=1741883236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1924430/extras/97c40f95bd3842e32df96a51ccd6b2dc.mp4?t=1741883236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the DEFINITIVE Cookie Cutter experience. Cookie Cutter Overkill Edition adds a ton of content to the original game. If you've played it before, experience it again with all new features, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully voiced dialogue for every character in the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New map features like the ability to gauge completion status</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brand new special moves and upgrades for Cherry</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Never-before-seen cinematics add even more style and background to the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tons of gameplay tweaks, progression balancing, and more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1924430/extras/475988ebf73f07abc8fcef8be455200d.poster.avif?t=1741883236\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1924430/extras/475988ebf73f07abc8fcef8be455200d.webm?t=1741883236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1924430/extras/475988ebf73f07abc8fcef8be455200d.mp4?t=1741883236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
