    "reviews": "\u201c\u201cEasily one of the best Metroidvanias of the year.\u201d\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 God is Geek<br><br>\u201c\u201cCookie Cutter\u2019s carefully constructed aesthetic reminds me of such champions as Aeon Flux, Ghost in the Shell, Hotline Miami, and Splatterhouse.\u201d\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Digital Chumps<br><br>\u201c\u201cCookie Cutter is a gory, gorgeous, and bloody good Metroidvania.\u201d\u201d<br>IGN<br>",
